═══ PROGRAM UJI COBA GABUNG ARRAY ═══
Larik a (5 elemen):
  a[0] = 10
  a[1] = 20
  a[2] = 30
  a[3] = 40
  a[4] = 50

Larik b (3 elemen):
  b[0] = 60
  b[1] = 70
  b[2] = 80

--- Menggabungkan Larik a dan Larik b ---
Hasil penggabungan (larik c):
  c[0] = 10
  c[1] = 20
  c[2] = 30
  c[3] = 40
  c[4] = 50
  c[5] = 60
  c[6] = 70
  c[7] = 80
✓ BERHASIL: Penggabungan larik berfungsi dengan benar!

--- Uji larik karakter ---
  teks3[0] = R
  teks3[1] = h
  teks3[2] = e
  teks3[3] = i
  teks3[4] = n
  teks3[5] = C

═══ PROGRAM SELESAI ═══
